MimicKit
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
  https://github.com/xbpeng/MimicKit, commit 2ed1e6c093bb0829f55d33cb4f7a1731cfe6cb69
  Copyright 2025, Xue Bin Peng. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  Upstream ships no NOTICE file.

  Modifications by the TOPPO authors (2026): every modified upstream file carries a change
  notice at its top; the modifications are listed in CHANGES.md and are contained in
  patches/0001-toppo-modifications-to-mimickit-2ed1e6c.patch. Five added files in
  overlay/mimickit/learning/ contain code adapted from MimicKit and say so in their headers:
  amp_sac_agent.py and amp_sac_model.py (from amp_agent.py and amp_model.py), sac_agent.py
