  The configurations in overlay/data/ are derived from MimicKit's as well: the 9 PPO agent
  configs are modified copies of data/agents/amp_task_humanoid_agent.yaml, the 16 SAC agent
  configs reuse its network, discriminator and reward settings, and the training and
  evaluation env configs are modified copies of data/envs/amp_steering_humanoid_env.yaml.
  Each of these 27 files carries a change notice at its top naming its upstream source, and
  CHANGES.md lists the changes.

